><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>1. 费用：</span></strong><span>夏令营不收取任何费用。</span></p><p><strong><span>2. 纪律要求：</span></strong><span>参营者需严格遵守国家法律法规、北京语言大学校规及夏令营活动安排。</span><span><strong><span>未按规定时间报到，或不按时参加活动，无故缺席者将被取消营员资格。</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span>3. 宣传与咨询：</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）请密切关注“北京语言大学心理与认知科学学院”官方微信公众号获取最新信息。</span></p><p><span>（2）联系人：杨老师</span></p><p><span>（3）咨询邮箱：yangyan@blcu.edu.cn（建议优先邮件咨询）</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7k4bC0yduxm3b2QUvIK1TibKuib9OhMKBbwqQjpiczZMG4xoWN0aZ8NSkBKwFJYib7F9oibIxHdwU8ricCBsvAChtsibw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、相关附件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7k4bC0yduxm3b2QUvIK1TibKuib9OhMKBbOQEMF8EcXQ9KdMia3NWfusjmxAJ3icUW5jvoJc6CHdbqrjESpicPcicT7A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XtFcV2q0NtauisN2wpeORA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1北京语言大学心理与认知科学学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表.pdf</a></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7k4bC0yduxm3b2QUvIK1TibKuib9OhMKBbwqQjpiczZMG4xoW